      "summaries": {
        "en": "Academic Research Skills is a prompt-based toolkit that transforms Claude Code into a structured research assistant, guiding users through the full academic pipeline: literature review, writing, peer review, and revision. Its key insight is breaking complex research workflows into modular, repeatable prompts that enforce rigor and consistency. You can use it to draft papers, simulate peer review, or automate literature synthesis—simply load the prompts into Claude Code and follow the step-by-step process.",
        "zh": "Academic Research Skills 是一套提示词工具包，可将 Claude Code 转化为结构化研究助手，引导用户完成文献综述、论文撰写、同行评审及修改定稿等完整学术流程。其核心设计理念是将复杂研究工作流拆解为模块化、可重复的提示词，确保学术严谨性与流程一致性。用户可在 Claude Code 中加载提示词，按步骤进行文献综合、草稿生成或模拟评审，显著提升研究效率。该项目适合需快速产出高质量成果的研究者，也适用于教学场景中演示标准学术流程。",
        "es": "Academic Research Skills is a prompt-based toolkit that transforms Claude Code into a structured research assistant, guiding users through the full academic pipeline: literature review, writing, peer review, and revision. Its key insight is breaking complex research workflows into modular, repeatable prompts that enforce rigor and consistency. You can use it to draft papers, simulate peer review, or automate literature synthesis—simply load the prompts into Claude Code and follow the step-by-step process.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "academic-research-skills stands out for academic-pipeline, academic-writing, and ai-research in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Academic Research Skills is a prompt-based toolkit that transforms Claude Code into a structured research assistant, guiding users through the full academic pipeline: literature review, writing, peer review, and revision. Its key insight is breaking complex research workflows into modular, repeatable prompts that enforce rigor and consistency. You can use it to draft papers, simulate peer review, or automate literature synthesis—simply load the prompts into Claude Code and follow the step-by-step process.",
