      "summaries": {
        "en": "Sana is an efficient text-to-image and video generation model that achieves high-resolution synthesis with a linear diffusion transformer. Its key innovation is replacing quadratic attention with linear attention, drastically reducing computational cost while maintaining quality. Combined with reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF) for alignment and NVFP4 quantization for deployment, Sana enables fast, high-quality generation on consumer GPUs. You can use it for rapid prototyping of visual content, fine-tune it on custom datasets, or deploy it in resource-constrained environments.",
        "zh": "Sana是一个高效的文本到图像及视频生成模型，通过线性扩散Transformer实现高分辨率合成。其核心创新在于用线性注意力机制替代传统的二次注意力，大幅降低计算开销的同时保持生成质量。结合基于人类反馈的强化学习（RLHF）进行对齐优化，并采用NVFP4量化技术便于部署，Sana能在消费级GPU上实现快速、高质量的生成。你可以用它快速原型化视觉内容，在自定义数据集上微调，或部署到资源受限的环境中。",
        "es": "Sana is an efficient text-to-image and video generation model that achieves high-resolution synthesis with a linear diffusion transformer. Its key innovation is replacing quadratic attention with linear attention, drastically reducing computational cost while maintaining quality. Combined with reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF) for alignment and NVFP4 quantization for deployment, Sana enables fast, high-quality generation on consumer GPUs. You can use it for rapid prototyping of visual content, fine-tune it on custom datasets, or deploy it in resource-constrained environments.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Sana stands out for diffusion, dit, and linear-transformer in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Sana is an efficient text-to-image and video generation model that achieves high-resolution synthesis with a linear diffusion transformer. Its key innovation is replacing quadratic attention with linear attention, drastically reducing computational cost while maintaining quality. Combined with reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF) for alignment and NVFP4 quantization for deployment, Sana enables fast, high-quality generation on consumer GPUs. You can use it for rapid prototyping of visual content, fine-tune it on custom datasets, or deploy it in resource-constrained environments.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/NVlabs/Sana for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
