      "summaries": {
        "en": "This cross-encoder model, fine-tuned on MS MARCO, scores the relevance of a query-document pair for text ranking. Its technical strength lies in using a compact 4-layer MiniLM architecture, which balances accuracy with speed, making it suitable for production retrieval pipelines. You can integrate it into a search system to re-rank top candidates from a first-stage retriever, improving result quality with minimal latency.",
        "zh": "这是一个基于MS MARCO数据集微调的交叉编码器模型，用于评估查询与文档之间的相关性，专为文本排序任务设计。其技术亮点在于采用轻量级的4层MiniLM架构，在保持较高准确率的同时显著提升推理速度，非常适合部署于生产环境的检索系统中。你可以将其作为重排序器，对第一阶段检索出的候选结果进行精细打分，从而显著提升搜索质量，而不会引入过多延迟。该模型支持PyTorch、ONNX、OpenVINO等多种框架，便于在不同硬件上优化运行。",
        "es": "This cross-encoder model, fine-tuned on MS MARCO, scores the relevance of a query-document pair for text ranking. Its technical strength lies in using a compact 4-layer MiniLM architecture, which balances accuracy with speed, making it suitable for production retrieval pipelines. You can integrate it into a search system to re-rank top candidates from a first-stage retriever, improving result quality with minimal latency.",
        "sections": {
