          "what": "This cross-encoder model, fine-tuned on MS MARCO, scores the relevance of a query-document pair for text ranking. Its technical strength lies in using a compact 4-layer MiniLM architecture, which balances accuracy with speed, making it suitable for production retrieval pipelines. You can integrate it into a search system to re-rank top candidates from a first-stage retriever, improving result quality with minimal latency.",
